  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## A · AI4SG Overview\n**Expert skills → Search → Extract & Interpretation → human audit.** Row 1 runs daily; row 2 is the audit page. Search (workflow B) and Extract & Interpretation (workflow C) are sub-workflows, each driven by one expert skill.",
        "width": 1900,
        "height": 110
      },
      "id": "3ebfed2c-4da4-5dbb-8062-4421475b3ff3",
      "name": "Note · title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧑‍🔬 Expert deliverables = the interface\n`skills/search/SKILL.md`: what counts as AI for Social Good; focus countries (with ISO code) and their languages, e.g. Bangladesh BD: bn, en · India IN: hi, bn, ta, en · Indonesia ID: id, en · Thailand TH: th, en; source types; local-language keywords; trusted sites; exclusions.  → used by **B · Search**\n`skills/extraction/SKILL.md` + `skills/extraction/examples/`: the fields to extract, how to interpret them (cost, benefit, beneficiaries, strength of evidence …), and the experts' own worked extractions.  → used by **C · Extract & Interpretation**",
        "width": 1900,
        "height": 150,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "3ada0b89-c395-5c8a-a5f2-c3b74e745a48",
      "name": "Skill interface",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -290
      ]
    },
